    "aboutHtml": "<p>I care about the details most people only notice when they’re missing: motion, performance, and how a screen behaves on a slow phone. These days I do that at <a href=\"https://www.headout.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Headout</a>, across React Native and Next.js.</p><p>Outside work I make things I want to use myself, like <a href=\"https://nomadsafe.pranav-agarwal.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NomadSafe</a>, a travel companion app, and <a href=\"https://grain.pranav-agarwal.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">grain</a>, a tool for reviewing pull requests as user flows. I also write about what I learn along the way: shaders, GPU memory, and running models on phones.</p>"
